# Weight profile nemotron-super-vl-exl3-2.0: NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Super VL 120B-A12B in our EXL3 pack at 2.0 bpw with -hq:
# routed experts at 2 bits, every other projection at 4, head 6, MTP head 4 to 6 (exllamav3 1.6.2 with the Puzzle/Bolt and
# Super VL patches, mul1 codebook; 36.84 GB, the RADIO vision tower kept in BF16 and loaded beside it), converted from
# nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Super-VL-120B-A12B-BF16 at revision 97e00975. Reads images (ENG-365). Measured 2026-10-16 against BF16
# (8 wikitext rows x 1,024): KL 0.325, top-1 82.1 %, perplexity 4.93 (the 4.0 pack 0.049 / 92.9 % / 3.94); decode
# 36.8 tok/s (4.0: 31.4). NVIDIA's LiLiCorr drafter for Super VL and the lookup, cut by StairCut: 35.6 / 46.2 / 46.3 /
# 125.1 / 139.2 tok/s on prose / chat / code / edit / copy asks (512 greedy, thinking off), every text the plain run's.
# The pack is in a public Hugging Face repository.
# Switch with ops/use-profile.sh nemotron-super-vl-exl3-2.0.
QSE_NH_MODEL=nemotron-3.5-super-vl-120b-a12b
QSE_NH_VARIANT=super-vl-exl3-2.0
QSE_NH_DIR=${HOME}/models/nemotron-3.5-super-vl-120b-a12b-exl3-2.0
QSE_WEIGHTS_GB=36.84
MAX_LEN=262144
# MemAvailable (GiB) a start needs: the weights (31.24 allocated, measured), the engine and its graphs, the allocator,
# the prefill workspace, three slots' KV and LiLiCorr's rings, LiLiCorr, the vision tower and the 15 GiB floor
QSE_MEM_NEED_GIB=66
# the engine's limits: 44.6 GiB taken from MemAvailable with LiLiCorr and 3 slots at 140,000 tokens (measured), the KV of
# three slots at 262,144 tokens and the vision tower with its image cache (2 GiB) on top; peak: the ceiling + the prefill
# workspace
MEM_CEILING_GIB=50
MEM_PEAK_GIB=54
# NVIDIA's LiLiCorr drafter for Super VL: a draft head of the tree drafter beside the lookup
QSE_NH_HEAD=lilicorr
QSE_NH_LILICORR=${HOME}/models/nemotron-3.5-super-vl-lilicorr
. "${REPO}/ops/profiles/_nemotron.env"
# ENG-365: the checkpoint's RADIO vision tower and projector (BF16, 1.60 GiB allocated at load, measured 2026-10-17) and
# the cache of encoded images (512 MB): the model reads images
VISION=on
QSE_WEIGHTS_HF=0xBakeer/TandemLLM-Nemotron-3.5-Super-VL-120B-A12B-EXL3-2.0
QSE_WEIGHTS_REVISION=c772513fab08034725c057aa6a02591332a4ffbb
QSE_ASSETS="${QSE_NH_LILICORR}/model.safetensors"
